   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 2.49,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Elimelech took his wife Naomi",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.61,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And two sons they called by name",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.5,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Mahlon and Chilion went with him",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.35,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Ephrathites from the holy place",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.94,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They crossed into the country Moab",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.77,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And settled down in alien space",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.47,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "She was left without her husband",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.25,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
